Days-26 WebDriver Methods
---------------------
1.get methods
2.conditional methods
3.browser methods
4.navigational methods
5.wait methods

1.get methods ->we can access these methods through webdriver instance
-----------------------
a.get(url) ->opens the url on the browser.
b.getTitle() ->returns title of the page.
c.getCurrentUrl() ->returns URL of the page.
d.getPageSource()->returns source code of the page.
e.getWindowHandle()->returns ID of the single browser window.
f.getWindowHandles() -> returns ID of the mulitple browser windows.

2.Conditional Methods - access these commands throught WebElement
--------------------------
returns boolean value(true/false)
isDisplayed() -> we can check display status of the element.
isEnabled()   -> we can check enable/disable status of the element/operational element.
isSelected()  -> we can use to check the element is selected or not.

3.browser Methods
--------------
a. close() - close single browser
b. quit()  - close multiple browser


